{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54232","headline":"六合怀古诗 芳草涧 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 芳草涧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳草涧边灌水（《光绪志》作「木」）阴，青青别有岁寒心。\n却缘飘落秋风後，才子临流亦费吟。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》注：「《嘉定志》。\n自此以下二十首皆郏滂《怀古诗》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}